{"availability":"available","full":"C5C3/cobaltcore","name":"cobaltcore","description":"Kubernetes-native operators and deployment stack for OpenStack Hosted Control Planes.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-02-28T11:16:25Z","updated":"2026-10-09T10:48:52Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://c5c3.github.io/cobaltcore/","topics":[],"demo":"https://c5c3.github.io/cobaltcore/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:01.793Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:01.793Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:01.793Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:15:17.708Z","stars":4,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:01.793Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kubernetes-native operators and deployment stack for OpenStack Hosted Control Planes.","Project website: cobaltcore.dev · Documentation: c5c3.github.io/cobaltcore · Issues: github.com/c5c3/cobaltcore/issues","CobaltCore (C5C3) is a Kubernetes-native OpenStack distribution for operating Hosted Control Planes. The project website at cobaltcore.dev introduces CobaltCore as a whole. This repository holds its control-plane stack: the declarative infrastructure manifests, one operator per OpenStack service, and the c5c3-operator, which orchestrates the service operators as children of a single ControlPlane resource. The operators are written in Go with the Operator SDK, controller-runtime, and Kubebuilder."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/C5C3/cobaltcore/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"18a31d3ccf10df003511ae269cd014256df0438f106a4c0b82c7cfe808b05b5b","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:17.844Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:17.844Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kubernetes-native operators and deployment stack for OpenStack Hosted Control Planes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/C5C3/cobaltcore/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],